Spider-like **Sentry Bots** are quicker than the Spider Tank and,
fortunately, far less deadly. Even so, the laser rifle mounted on each
one's head deserves respect. *Armored +1, Attack (Laser Rifle) +1,
Combat Expert +2, Heightened Sense (Vision) +2, Quick +2; Clumsy −1,
Emotionless −3, Vulnerability (Electricity) −2.*

